 "best_idea": "Keep a look-ahead point a fixed on-screen distance ahead of the hero, ease it toward its target by a fixed share each update, move the view only when that point leaves an edge dead zone, and let a manual pan above a small threshold hand control back to the player.",
 "decision": "adapt",
 "decision_why": "The dead zone, fixed-distance look-ahead and manual-input hand-over are the shape a third-person follow camera needs and the owner's world camera lacks; the donor is 2D with per-pass smoothing, so smoothing must be time-based and yaw, pitch and wall pull-in must be added.",
